# REVERT PATCH — File Explorer glass fixes (commit b607c46)
#
# هذا الملف يحتوي كل الأسطر المضافة (+) والمحذوفة (-) للتعديل الأخير
# This file contains every added (+) and deleted (-) line of the fix.
#
# للتراجع عن التعديل كاملاً / To revert everything:
#   git apply -R FE_GLASS_FIX_revert.diff
#   ثم / then:  cargo build -p pecofence-tap
#
# أو للتراجع عن ملف واحد فقط / To revert a single file:
#   git checkout b607c46~1 -- <path/to/file>
# ===================================================================
commit b607c4621f6e519447e1cc8444f8e68898b79919
Author: fox10881 <fox10881@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Sun Nov 1 01:24:21 2026 +0300

    Fix File Explorer glass: five bugs behind the solid black/gray void
    
    1) mux StyleVal::Blur — make_blur_brush_any produces a Windows.UI.Xaml
       compositor brush; SetValue on Microsoft.UI.Xaml elements failed
       E_NOINTERFACE. Blur now resolves through per-module blur_brush():
       wux keeps the compositor path, mux loads a native
       Microsoft.UI.Xaml.Media.AcrylicBrush via the mux XamlReader (no
       BackgroundSource on WinUI3) with a translucent SolidColorBrush
       fallback (alpha clamped 0x25..=0x40, never opaque).
    
    2) DWM mutual exclusion — SYSTEMBACKDROP_TYPE (2/3/4) and
       WCA_ACCENT_POLICY acrylic are never both active now (the solid
       black void): blur-effect OR a color tint drops backdrop to
       DWMSBT_AUTO and enables DwmEnableBlurBehindWindow + accent acrylic
       with the tint GradientColor; untinted acrylic/mica keeps the system
       backdrop with accent disabled. A new FEBD COPYDATA pushes the
       desired backdrop/accent/gradient to the resident, whose
       dwm_setattr_hook now substitutes that value for explorer's rewrites
       instead of silently swallowing, and fe_glass applies the full
       DWM state in-process on arm/disarm.
    
    3) Opaque theme panels — MainContentBG Opacity 1->0 and the listed
       chrome/Home/Gallery/Details targets get Background=Transparent
       (last-wins) across the six glass presets; glass presets also carry
       the transparent WindowCaptionBackground / SolidBackgroundFillColor*
       / LayerFillColorDefault / ApplicationPageBackgroundThemeBrush
       resvars as typed Color/Brush objects.
    
    4) HTHEME cache miss — OpenThemeData only records handles opened
       after arming; class_of() now falls back to uxtheme Ordinal 74
       (GetThemeClass) so pre-arm handles resolve too, and TMT_TEXTCOLOR
       on the DirectUI classes is forced white on the dark glass.
    
    5) Scoping/refresh — FillRect now catches the COLOR_WINDOW+1
       pseudo-brush, and DrawThemeBackground(Ex) scope to
       cabinet_dc || thread_has_cabinet so BeginBufferedPaint memory DCs
       (WindowFromDC=NULL) on cabinet threads are punched too. Arm,
       backdrop-update and disarm now broadcast WM_THEMECHANGED +
       RedrawWindow to every CabinetWClass for an immediate repaint.
    
